New deikhan skill: plate.

1) Plate builds a piece of armor up one tier.
   - Clothing becomes light, light medium, medium heavy.
   - More protection, fewer classes able to wear it.

2) Material hardness caps how far anything can climb.
   - Silk will never be plate armor, whatever your skill.
   - A mage's transmutation is what opens the ladder above soft stock.
   - The material is checked again when you finish, in case it changed
     while you worked.

3) What a smith can install is capped.
   - A piece already finer than that ceiling keeps what it has and only
     changes tier.

See HELP PLATE and HELP AUGMENTATION.
